WEBVTT

01:26.660 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.560 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 20]

01:33.640 --> 01:35.170
What the Rong family took in

01:35.400 --> 01:36.680
was a poor woman who was beaten

01:36.680 --> 01:39.000
by her mother-in-law and husband
until she miscarried.

01:39.000 --> 01:39.759
She was bedridden for three months

01:39.759 --> 01:41.220
before she escaped death.

01:41.590 --> 01:42.759
She neither killed nor burned,

01:42.759 --> 01:43.509
nor did she transgress in any way.

01:43.509 --> 01:45.039
How could she be a criminal?

01:45.280 --> 01:46.710
Even if she were brought to the court,

01:46.710 --> 01:48.870
she would be a witness, not the accused.

01:48.870 --> 01:50.120
But you even intend to shift the blame

01:50.120 --> 01:52.050
for false accusation onto others?

01:52.229 --> 01:52.680
How can there be

01:52.680 --> 01:54.440
such an easy way out in this world?

01:54.440 --> 01:54.800
You!

01:54.820 --> 01:55.350
Father,

01:58.200 --> 01:59.200
please calm down.

02:00.710 --> 02:02.310
Miss Rong makes a valid point.

02:02.310 --> 02:02.870
Now is not the time

02:02.870 --> 02:04.600
to shift blame onto each other.

02:08.710 --> 02:09.630
I hope Miss Rong,

02:09.630 --> 02:12.590
considering the past friendship
between our families,

02:12.590 --> 02:15.250
can show our Yang family
in the right direction.

02:19.340 --> 02:21.280
The Wei family mistreated my aunt first.

02:21.280 --> 02:23.040
Their downfall was their own doing,

02:23.040 --> 02:24.590
and they can't blame others.

02:24.590 --> 02:26.370
My family stepped back many times,

02:26.370 --> 02:28.240
all for the sake of
my aunt and her husband's harmony.

02:28.240 --> 02:29.710
Later, despite our exhaustive efforts
to find her,

02:29.710 --> 02:32.120
we accused him
of murder in a moment of righteous anger.

02:32.120 --> 02:34.050
Yet, many hidden grievances
and circumstances

02:34.050 --> 02:36.150
are difficult to share with outsiders.

02:36.150 --> 02:38.400
There's just one thing
I must tell Miss Rong:

02:38.400 --> 02:39.470
the ones who filed the lawsuit

02:39.470 --> 02:41.070
were indeed the Yang family.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.590
But with the multiple subsequent retrials

02:42.590 --> 02:43.390
implicating

02:43.560 --> 02:45.290
countless unexpected events,

02:46.030 --> 02:46.800
the Yang family has long

02:46.800 --> 02:48.860
since lost control of the situation.

02:50.150 --> 02:50.950
Are you saying

02:52.000 --> 02:53.800
the Yang family was also coerced

02:54.270 --> 02:55.470
with no other choice?

03:03.150 --> 03:03.710
Father.

03:05.800 --> 03:07.750
Miss Rong generously sheltered my aunt

03:07.750 --> 03:09.560
and took on countless responsibilities.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.710
Her anger now

03:11.060 --> 03:12.590
is for my aunt's injustice.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.430
You shouldn't be angry;

03:14.870 --> 03:17.800
instead, you should thank her
for her noble integrity.

03:17.800 --> 03:19.910
Since things have reached this point now,

03:19.910 --> 03:21.710
it's pointless to argue
who's right or wrong.

03:21.710 --> 03:23.640
Both families must face the court,

03:24.120 --> 03:25.579
so we should work together

03:25.910 --> 03:27.170
to resolve the grudges

03:28.430 --> 03:31.240
and turn conflict into peace.

03:32.320 --> 03:33.390
I'm just worried

03:33.420 --> 03:35.630
that your aunt
may resent her maiden family and,

03:35.630 --> 03:37.710
if provoked by someone
with ulterior motives,

03:37.710 --> 03:39.510
might speak recklessly in court

03:39.710 --> 03:41.110
and ruin the big picture.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.820
After so many years apart,

03:45.280 --> 03:46.280
I don't know what my aunt's temperament

03:46.280 --> 03:47.810
or personality is like now.

03:47.870 --> 03:50.680
Can Miss Rong give us some advice, please?

03:59.820 --> 04:01.260
I have a couple of things to say,

04:01.260 --> 04:03.720
though I'm not sure
if I should bring them up.

04:09.180 --> 04:09.770
Yunshu?

04:13.830 --> 04:15.270
Eldest Sister,
you've always been so smart.

04:15.270 --> 04:17.079
A small thing like this
is hardly an obstacle for you.

04:17.079 --> 04:18.680
You just don't have the heart
to go through with it.

04:18.680 --> 04:19.560
Then let me be

04:19.560 --> 04:20.690
the bad person here.

04:21.829 --> 04:23.270
Uncle Yang, Mr. Yang.

04:23.750 --> 04:25.800
Although the government has arrested him,

04:25.800 --> 04:27.340
the truth hasn't been confirmed yet.

04:27.340 --> 04:28.800
What is the evidence then?

04:34.800 --> 04:35.310
What?

04:36.100 --> 04:37.760
Don't you two understand yet?

05:03.600 --> 05:06.040
He hasn't spoken a word?

05:06.870 --> 05:08.840
My Lord, he hasn't spoken.

05:17.000 --> 05:19.950
This case is difficult to judge.

05:21.430 --> 05:24.160
News of the Imperial Inspector's drowning

05:24.340 --> 05:27.480
reached the capital

05:28.220 --> 05:30.580
and infuriated His Majesty.

05:31.120 --> 05:33.720
He ordered Xu Song, the Prefect of Linji,

05:33.960 --> 05:36.420
to personally take over the investigation.

05:36.580 --> 05:39.670
Xu Song
dared not delegate to others.

05:40.310 --> 05:42.720
He brought
the accused and evidence to court

05:42.720 --> 05:44.720
and examined
the details of the case

05:44.920 --> 05:47.050
one by one with strict interrogation.

05:47.240 --> 05:50.740
The suspect,
Wei Kejian, has lost his sanity

05:51.560 --> 05:53.960
and can't even utter the word "injustice".

05:54.560 --> 05:57.360
Given this, Xu Song made sure

05:57.900 --> 06:00.630
all official procedures
appeared impeccably proper.

06:00.630 --> 06:03.630
Moreover, this case has passed
through many hands,

06:04.070 --> 06:06.950
and every official involved
now fears implication.

06:06.950 --> 06:10.430
Which one of them would permit a retrial?

06:11.160 --> 06:14.680
My advice to you is this:
Caution and Discretion.

06:15.390 --> 06:18.080
That's the key point.

06:18.950 --> 06:20.610
I nearly lost my life in Linji,

06:21.190 --> 06:22.160
so I know how deep

06:22.160 --> 06:23.290
this water truly is.

06:23.640 --> 06:25.370
But since I've taken this case,

06:26.080 --> 06:27.060
I will face all dangers

06:27.060 --> 06:28.520
and get to the bottom of it.

06:29.310 --> 06:31.230
Only then will I be worthy
of the long journey

06:31.230 --> 06:32.730
you undertook to secure
the imperial decree

06:32.730 --> 06:34.130
that verified my status.

06:34.850 --> 06:37.090
Though Wei Kejian has gone mad,

06:38.120 --> 06:39.270
he is still

06:39.270 --> 06:41.920
under Xu Song's strict supervision.

06:42.870 --> 06:43.510
I am afraid

06:43.870 --> 06:47.310
that Xu Song won't let you
see him easily.

06:47.920 --> 06:52.560
Fortunately,
you've got Madam Yang yourself.

06:53.510 --> 06:53.950
She

06:54.409 --> 06:57.760
is the only solid evidence in this case.

07:01.390 --> 07:04.630
You must force her to talk.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.000
Don't worry, Mentor.

07:14.560 --> 07:16.360
I will definitely make her talk.

07:34.360 --> 07:34.830
My Lord.

07:35.390 --> 07:37.050
I understand. You may go back.

07:38.190 --> 07:40.310
Please give us your instructions, My Lord.

07:40.310 --> 07:41.000
Minister Xu

07:41.000 --> 07:43.000
has come with the Emperor's decree.

07:43.630 --> 07:45.790
The Ministry of Justice
has rejected the case files.

07:45.790 --> 07:47.700
The case will be retried.

07:48.360 --> 07:50.690
Holy Mother and Son, may you live forever!

07:52.240 --> 07:52.750
Good.

07:53.830 --> 07:54.430
Good bird.

07:55.270 --> 07:59.159
The Empress Dowager's birthday
is followed by the Longevity Festival.

07:59.159 --> 08:01.190
I'm counting on all of you

08:01.360 --> 08:04.220
to make me look good
in front of the Empress Dowager.

08:05.600 --> 08:06.830
But, My Lord...

08:07.950 --> 08:09.610
Just let him try the case then.

08:10.510 --> 08:11.750
That old lord

08:11.750 --> 08:12.870
is about to retire.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.510
He's already one foot in the grave,

08:15.510 --> 08:17.560
yet he still came specially
to watch you preside over this case.

08:17.560 --> 08:19.420
If you don't preside over it well,

08:19.560 --> 08:20.760
how will you survive

08:20.830 --> 08:22.560
in the officialdom after this?

08:23.870 --> 08:26.070
No water can rise above the ship's mast.

08:26.240 --> 08:28.500
No hand can be big enough
to cover the sky.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.530
All people in this world

08:31.260 --> 08:32.460
have their own fates.

08:34.789 --> 08:35.549
Just go back.

08:35.870 --> 08:38.030
It's not your turn to be anxious yet.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.760
Allow me to take my leave.

08:52.390 --> 08:52.990
Miss Rong.

08:59.000 --> 08:59.480
What an imposing

08:59.480 --> 09:01.030
and powerful Imperial Inspector Lu!

09:01.030 --> 09:02.670
Does he forget how he was once
clinging to life by a thread,

09:02.670 --> 09:04.730
gravely wounded and awaiting death?

09:04.870 --> 09:05.550
If not for your kindness

09:05.550 --> 09:06.480
in taking him in,

09:06.720 --> 09:08.200
how could he still be alive?

09:08.200 --> 09:09.960
He'd have been eaten
by vultures and wolves,

09:09.960 --> 09:11.970
let alone coming to throw
his weight around at the Rong family!

09:11.970 --> 09:12.970
What an ungrateful

09:12.970 --> 09:14.700
and disrespectful damned man!

09:14.790 --> 09:16.870
We're not going!
Drive those officers away.

09:16.870 --> 09:18.470
We're definitely not going!

09:18.510 --> 09:20.710
If we don't accept a polite invitation,

09:21.000 --> 09:22.290
then the government
will come to arrest us.

09:22.290 --> 09:23.030
How dare him?

09:24.650 --> 09:27.150
Miss Rong, the Emperor has given

09:27.150 --> 09:28.440
his imperial word to reopen the Wei case.

09:28.440 --> 09:30.240
All of Linji is buzzing about it.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.700
Everyone is waiting to see

09:31.840 --> 09:33.440
how this case will be solved.

09:33.750 --> 09:35.080
When officials arrested Madam Yang,

09:35.080 --> 09:36.480
she was with Lady Yunwan.

09:36.850 --> 09:38.910
I'm afraid we can't hide where Madam Yang

09:38.910 --> 09:40.710
has been hiding all these years.

09:41.090 --> 09:42.550
But Lady Yunwan's side...

09:47.910 --> 09:50.790
Didn't he want the witness
to be present in the court?

09:50.790 --> 09:51.320
I will go.

09:58.910 --> 10:00.440
They've recently dotted the hillslope

10:00.440 --> 10:02.510
beneath this tea grove
with chrysanthemums and orchids.

10:02.510 --> 10:04.240
Now, with the autumn blossoms
in full display,

10:04.240 --> 10:05.960
the view is a delight to the senses.

10:05.960 --> 10:07.440
Old Madam,
you often stroll here to unwind,

10:07.440 --> 10:09.770
which'll never fail to lift your spirits.

10:10.120 --> 10:11.440
This was Bao's idea?

10:12.120 --> 10:12.440
Yes.

10:21.600 --> 10:22.860
Who would have thought

10:23.670 --> 10:24.390
that tea trees could thrive alongside

10:24.390 --> 10:26.780
wild chrysanthemums
and grow so vigorously?

10:26.780 --> 10:28.560
I recall Miss Rong mentioned
that next year,

10:28.560 --> 10:30.870
varieties of chrysanthemum
are to be carefully chosen

10:30.870 --> 10:32.220
for both petals and roots

10:32.220 --> 10:33.820
that can be used in medicine.

10:34.000 --> 10:34.750
No wonder you're being so kind,

10:34.750 --> 10:37.000
accompanying an old woman like me
for a walk.

10:37.000 --> 10:39.660
It turns out
that you're speaking on her behalf.

10:40.310 --> 10:42.310
She won't appreciate your efforts.

10:46.320 --> 10:48.120
Lady Rong, Miss Rong...

10:48.120 --> 10:48.840
Enough.

10:49.510 --> 10:51.570
It's rare for me to come out for a stroll.

10:51.570 --> 10:53.970
Let's not talk about troublesome matters.

10:55.650 --> 10:57.560
I know your heart is full of sincerity,

10:57.560 --> 10:59.470
far better than that Lu fellow.

11:00.540 --> 11:02.390
But unfortunately,
you keep everything bottled up inside.

11:02.390 --> 11:04.790
You do good deeds
but no one knows about them.

11:04.790 --> 11:05.790
You're honest...

11:07.760 --> 11:08.730
To a fault.

11:10.870 --> 11:12.900
Miss Rong insists on appearing in court.

11:12.900 --> 11:14.750
She must have a well-thought-out plan.

11:14.750 --> 11:15.720
Miss, you have lost

11:15.720 --> 11:17.080
a lot of weight these past few days.

11:17.080 --> 11:19.010
You'd take better care of yourself

11:19.360 --> 11:21.290
and not worry so much about others.

11:22.590 --> 11:24.550
How could the court
be a pleasant place to visit?

11:24.550 --> 11:26.650
The Rong family stands in Linji
because of its reputation.

11:26.650 --> 11:29.360
Eldest Sister's position
is extremely important.

11:29.360 --> 11:30.630
If she loses in court,

11:31.100 --> 11:32.830
it means the Rong family loses.

11:33.270 --> 11:34.360
Those who understand

11:34.360 --> 11:35.550
will say Eldest Sister is virtuous

11:35.550 --> 11:37.080
and took pity on Madam Yang.

11:37.080 --> 11:38.740
Those who don't know the truth

11:39.120 --> 11:41.390
will surely say
our family is harboring a criminal

11:41.390 --> 11:43.060
to seize the Wei family's tea plantation.

11:43.060 --> 11:44.860
How does that reputation sound?

11:45.270 --> 11:46.840
Grandmother is getting old now.

11:46.840 --> 11:48.360
How could she bear such disgrace?

11:48.360 --> 11:49.270
Well said.

11:53.000 --> 11:53.800
Grandmother.

11:54.860 --> 11:56.790
I'm impressed you thought of this.

11:57.670 --> 11:58.910
You are even more

11:59.390 --> 12:01.320
sensible and filial than Shanbao.

12:01.630 --> 12:04.030
I'm not stopping her
from doing good deeds.

12:04.080 --> 12:05.940
But as the head of the Rong family,

12:06.330 --> 12:08.130
I must see further than she does.

12:08.670 --> 12:10.070
Saving one person's life

12:10.080 --> 12:11.240
is a small kindness.

12:11.630 --> 12:13.790
Bearing responsibility for thousands of
tea workers' livelihoods

12:13.790 --> 12:15.120
is the greater good.

12:16.150 --> 12:18.120
To think that just to save Madam Yang,

12:18.120 --> 12:18.790
we must sacrifice the Rong family's

12:18.790 --> 12:20.200
century-old reputation

12:20.750 --> 12:23.030
and abandon the duty
that rests on our shoulders!

12:23.030 --> 12:24.960
How could I not be furious with her?

12:25.030 --> 12:27.090
It's me, being not resilient enough.

12:27.440 --> 12:28.240
Grandmother.

12:28.660 --> 12:29.670
Eldest Sister already has

12:29.670 --> 12:30.360
a solution.

12:30.960 --> 12:32.290
She won't lose in court.

12:33.120 --> 12:34.920
Please don't blame her anymore.

12:36.630 --> 12:37.390
Alright.

12:39.360 --> 12:40.000
Yesterday,

12:40.000 --> 12:42.230
the calming pillow you sent was excellent.

12:42.230 --> 12:43.810
My maid used to make ones

12:43.910 --> 12:45.870
with sandalwood and borneol too.

12:46.870 --> 12:48.910
But they weren't as effective as yours.

12:48.910 --> 12:50.600
I added my own sun-dried

12:50.600 --> 12:52.060
gardenia petals and mint.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.470
I was afraid you couldn't sleep well,

12:54.470 --> 12:57.200
so I added them to help you relax
and sleep better.

12:59.240 --> 13:00.120
Lately,

13:00.510 --> 13:02.370
are your eyes getting any better?

13:03.030 --> 13:05.560
What medicine
have you been taking recently?

13:19.050 --> 13:21.000
So it is truly the Wei family's case.

13:21.000 --> 13:22.440
The real culprit has gone mad,

13:22.440 --> 13:23.900
so what's to investigate?

13:24.270 --> 13:25.330
Haven't you heard?

13:25.630 --> 13:27.440
The wife who died over ten years ago

13:27.440 --> 13:28.640
has come back to life.

13:28.910 --> 13:30.720
No wonder everyone is like flies to blood,

13:30.720 --> 13:32.050
rushing here in swarms.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.270
Everyone wants to see

13:33.270 --> 13:34.790
how people can return from the dead.

13:34.790 --> 13:36.080
Come on, let's go have a look too.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.280
How is that possible?

13:41.270 --> 13:42.150
Let's go.

13:42.600 --> 13:44.200
Let's see what's happening.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.150
We must go take a look.

13:45.150 --> 13:45.770
Don't push.

13:45.770 --> 13:47.980
[Linzhang Government]

13:48.510 --> 13:50.910
Might!

13:50.910 --> 13:53.870
Power!

14:01.440 --> 14:02.040
Miss Rong.

14:02.220 --> 14:03.680
If Old Master finds out...

14:04.950 --> 14:06.680
Then we just won't let him know.

14:09.730 --> 14:10.590
Here they come.

14:12.270 --> 14:14.730
As your guest,
I'd follow your lead, Lord Xu.

14:15.000 --> 14:16.530
How about you take the lead?

14:21.860 --> 14:22.390
I forgot.

14:23.440 --> 14:24.480
Lord Xu's verdict

14:24.480 --> 14:26.320
has been rejected
by the Ministry of Justice.

14:26.320 --> 14:27.770
Today, it's more appropriate

14:27.770 --> 14:29.610
that I preside over the proceedings.

14:29.610 --> 14:30.070
Please.

14:44.790 --> 14:46.350
Bring forth witnesses Madam Yang

14:46.350 --> 14:47.910
and Yang Jisheng to the court.

14:47.910 --> 14:50.510
Bring Madam Yang
and Yang Jisheng to the court!

15:04.950 --> 15:06.110
I, Yang Jisheng,

15:06.150 --> 15:07.810
pay my respects to both lords.

15:08.390 --> 15:09.190
Yang Jisheng.

15:10.390 --> 15:12.320
Open your eyes and look carefully.

15:12.600 --> 15:14.360
Who is standing beside you?

15:15.630 --> 15:17.230
You accused your brother-in-law Wei Kejian

15:17.230 --> 15:18.490
of beating his wife to death.

15:18.490 --> 15:20.160
Now Madam Yang has been found.

15:21.730 --> 15:23.260
What else do you have to say?

15:30.120 --> 15:30.720
My Lord,

15:31.540 --> 15:33.200
this is not my sister Yang Yun.

15:40.010 --> 15:41.340
You keep your mouth shut

15:41.490 --> 15:43.280
and refuse to admit you're Yang Yun.

15:43.280 --> 15:44.250
It's only because you fear your brother

15:44.250 --> 15:45.320
would be charged with false accusation

15:45.320 --> 15:47.050
and the entire Yang family
would be punished.

15:47.050 --> 15:49.450
For this, you'd rather hide your identity,

15:49.470 --> 15:50.790
willingly serve as
a servant in the Rong family,

15:50.790 --> 15:52.670
and live as a walking dead
for your entire life.

15:52.670 --> 15:54.660
Yang Yun, how foolish you are.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.200
Go to the court and see

15:56.340 --> 15:58.140
how your Yang family treats you.

15:58.360 --> 15:59.150
Who are you?

16:00.000 --> 16:00.910
How dare you come to court

16:00.910 --> 16:02.970
and falsely claim to be our relative?

16:03.120 --> 16:03.600
My Lord,

16:04.240 --> 16:05.710
Yun is my very own dear sister

16:05.710 --> 16:07.240
and we have the same mother.

16:07.270 --> 16:07.960
How could a brother

16:07.960 --> 16:09.620
not recognize his own sister?

16:10.870 --> 16:13.020
There is some resemblance in appearance,

16:13.020 --> 16:15.020
but she is absolutely not my sister.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.110
How can you be so sure?

16:18.340 --> 16:18.810
My Lord,

16:19.320 --> 16:21.180
the notorious case of Wei Kejian,

16:21.520 --> 16:23.270
who cruelly killed his wife,
shook Jiangnan to its core.

16:23.270 --> 16:25.270
Despite repeated investigations
for ten years,

16:25.270 --> 16:26.480
no verdict has been reached,

16:26.480 --> 16:28.210
which is common knowledge now.

16:28.790 --> 16:30.320
If she were truly my sister,

16:30.390 --> 16:32.510
why would she hide herself
for so many years?

16:32.510 --> 16:33.320
Why would she stand by and watch

16:33.320 --> 16:35.580
the Yang and Wei families clash in court,

16:35.720 --> 16:36.790
watch her innocent husband

16:36.790 --> 16:38.050
imprisoned unjustly,

16:38.150 --> 16:39.200
watch the Wei family fall into ruin

16:39.200 --> 16:40.290
and its members scatter,

16:40.290 --> 16:42.320
and watch her mother-in-law waste away
from hunger and cold?

16:42.320 --> 16:42.870
Why?

16:43.960 --> 16:46.480
My sister, Yang Yun, is a woman
of both knowledge and virtue,

16:46.480 --> 16:47.630
renowned for her exemplary filial piety,

16:47.630 --> 16:49.480
graceful decorum,
and peerless moral character.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.480
How could she commit such unfilial

16:51.720 --> 16:53.210
and unconscionable acts?

16:54.270 --> 16:55.480
It must be the Wei family's people

16:55.480 --> 16:56.440
who want to reopen the case

16:56.440 --> 16:59.150
and found this woman
to deliberately deceive us.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.880
How pitiful!

17:00.630 --> 17:01.360
My poor, innocent sister,

17:01.360 --> 17:02.750
cruelly slain,

17:03.120 --> 17:05.050
now bears this guilt even in death.

17:05.880 --> 17:07.680
Her name dragged through the mud,

17:07.680 --> 17:09.940
her very being devoured, flesh and bone!

17:10.510 --> 17:11.349
My Lords,

17:12.560 --> 17:14.270
please uphold justice
for me,

17:14.510 --> 17:16.040
and clear my sister's name!

17:16.920 --> 17:18.720
Lord Lu, you heard all that?

17:19.440 --> 17:21.310
Yang Jisheng and Yang Yun

17:21.310 --> 17:22.970
are siblings, immediate kin.

17:23.270 --> 17:25.869
Even if others failed
to recognize Madam Yang,

17:26.720 --> 17:28.050
he certainly would not.

17:28.480 --> 17:30.640
Moreover, every point he made was valid.

17:30.640 --> 17:32.750
If Madam Yang were truly alive,

17:33.680 --> 17:35.550
why'd she remain hidden

17:35.720 --> 17:37.720
and watch her husband be condemned?

17:39.160 --> 17:41.790
This simply doesn't make sense.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.210
I did hear that.

17:44.080 --> 17:44.740
Madam Yang,

17:45.350 --> 17:46.270
everyone in court can hear

17:46.270 --> 17:47.640
Yang Jisheng's words,

17:47.640 --> 17:49.750
but you alone are deaf and blind,

17:49.750 --> 17:50.550
with a leaf before the eye.

17:50.550 --> 17:51.310
I fear all your devoted efforts

17:51.310 --> 17:53.480
have been spent sheltering
a nest of serpents

17:53.480 --> 17:55.080
you've warmed in your bosom!

17:55.590 --> 17:57.590
My Lord, everyone in my Yang family,

17:57.590 --> 17:58.680
all 170 members,

17:58.700 --> 17:59.830
can testify to this.

18:00.070 --> 18:01.640
If you still don't believe me, My Lord,

18:01.640 --> 18:03.240
you can summon Yang family relatives

18:03.240 --> 18:04.720
and longtime neighbors.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.590
They are people

18:06.590 --> 18:07.750
who witnessed Yun grow up

18:07.750 --> 18:09.350
and who have seen me
escort her to her wedding.

18:09.350 --> 18:10.550
They can all attest

18:10.790 --> 18:11.990
that not a single word

18:12.000 --> 18:13.800
of what I've said today is false.

18:14.090 --> 18:14.750
Madam Yang!

18:15.770 --> 18:16.790
They want to drink your blood

18:16.790 --> 18:17.790
and devour your flesh.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.050
Are you still going to remain obstinate?

18:23.290 --> 18:24.620
You don't recognize me,

18:26.070 --> 18:27.720
but I recognize who you are.

18:28.110 --> 18:30.000
I recognized you

18:30.000 --> 18:31.390
when you gathered
your friends for drinking bouts,

18:31.390 --> 18:33.310
were expelled
by the mentor of Songhe Academy,

18:33.310 --> 18:35.130
and received
thirty lashes from our father.

18:35.130 --> 18:37.200
I recognized your wolf-hearted nature

18:37.200 --> 18:38.390
and your profit-driven mind.

18:38.390 --> 18:39.360
Knowing full well the Wei family

18:39.360 --> 18:40.590
had abused a daughter-in-law to death,

18:40.590 --> 18:42.370
yet you still
threw your own sister into that inferno.

18:42.370 --> 18:44.490
I recognized your mouth
full of benevolence and virtue,

18:44.490 --> 18:46.480
constantly using filial duty
and moral rectitude to pressure me,

18:46.480 --> 18:47.270
feeding my flesh and blood to fill

18:47.270 --> 18:48.550
the Wei family's pit of suffering

18:48.550 --> 18:50.090
while you lived a carefree life.

18:50.090 --> 18:51.790
I recognized you--cunning as a fox

18:51.790 --> 18:52.590
and greedy as a wolf--who,

18:52.590 --> 18:54.240
for the sake of three hundred mu
of Wei family tea fields,

18:54.240 --> 18:55.880
fabricated charges to accuse
your brother-in-law of murder,

18:55.880 --> 18:58.210
bringing ruin
upon the entire Wei family.

18:58.410 --> 18:59.040
My Lord!

19:00.480 --> 19:01.310
I have said it.

19:03.740 --> 19:05.870
I've endured this for ten whole years.

19:06.350 --> 19:07.480
If I didn't speak up,

19:08.110 --> 19:10.310
I'd have suffocated from holding it in.

19:11.090 --> 19:12.520
You liar!

19:13.560 --> 19:15.160
My Lord, don't believe her.

19:15.310 --> 19:16.240
She's a liar!

19:18.200 --> 19:18.960
This woman's story

19:18.960 --> 19:20.400
has details and makes sense.

19:20.400 --> 19:21.730
It doesn't sound false.

19:21.960 --> 19:22.590
This Yang family

19:22.590 --> 19:24.110
is truly despicable.

19:24.110 --> 19:26.550
Madam Yang, since you're still alive,

19:27.200 --> 19:29.480
why didn't you
come forward earlier to testify?

19:29.480 --> 19:31.680
Yes, why did you wait until now?

19:54.270 --> 19:56.170
Please examine that, My Lord.

20:06.900 --> 20:08.200
What are they looking at?

20:08.200 --> 20:09.960
-Such a large scar.
-An old scar.

20:09.960 --> 20:10.550
It really exists.

20:10.550 --> 20:11.410
Indeed it does.

20:14.980 --> 20:15.440
My Lord,

20:16.070 --> 20:17.070
this woman has

20:17.070 --> 20:18.330
an old scar on her head,

20:18.550 --> 20:20.790
which is deep, narrow,
and over 7cm long.

20:20.790 --> 20:21.450
Madam Yang,

20:22.720 --> 20:24.380
where does this scar come from

20:24.670 --> 20:26.550
and what does it have to do
with this case?

20:26.550 --> 20:28.550
Since I married into the Wei family,

20:28.590 --> 20:31.110
I've suffered constant abuse
from my mother-in-law

20:31.110 --> 20:33.840
and had a strained relationship
with Wei Kejian.

20:34.130 --> 20:37.300
That night,
he believed his mother's slander

20:38.400 --> 20:41.530
and accused me of not being
respectful enough to elders.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.420
I'll beat you to death!

20:43.590 --> 20:45.400
You worthless woman!
I won't let you escape!

20:45.400 --> 20:46.750
I'll kill you!

20:47.060 --> 20:48.830
You worthless woman! Go to hell!

20:48.830 --> 20:49.640
Why are you

20:49.640 --> 20:51.170
making Mother angry again?

20:51.220 --> 20:53.480
-Let go! Let go!
-I’ll kill you!

20:55.240 --> 20:56.000
Let go!

21:02.030 --> 21:03.240
What woman in this world

21:03.240 --> 21:04.440
can't bear children?

21:04.510 --> 21:05.790
I would have had grandchildren by now.

21:05.790 --> 21:07.380
I never liked her
since the very beginning.

21:07.380 --> 21:08.640
I’ll kill you!
Mother!

21:08.920 --> 21:10.400
Mother, please stop beating!

21:10.400 --> 21:11.680
You'll kill her if you continue!

21:11.680 --> 21:12.140
Mother!

21:12.510 --> 21:13.750
Stop it! Stop it!

21:14.000 --> 21:15.000
-Mother!
-Let go!

21:15.750 --> 21:16.270
Mother!

21:23.100 --> 21:24.560
I barely managed to escape

21:24.960 --> 21:26.170
and save my life.

21:27.320 --> 21:29.920
The Wei and Yang families
were in a legal dispute.

21:29.920 --> 21:31.200
After much consideration,

21:31.200 --> 21:33.460
I did decide to come forward as a witness.

21:33.640 --> 21:36.070
Just as I returned to my maiden home
to discuss the matter,

21:36.070 --> 21:36.440
he...

21:37.660 --> 21:39.920
He feared I'd expose the false accusation,

21:39.920 --> 21:41.920
so he pretended to consult the clan.

21:42.610 --> 21:44.030
In the evening, he drugged me to faint

21:44.030 --> 21:46.070
and tried to drown me
in the backyard's well.

21:46.070 --> 21:47.370
When I awoke during the attempt,

21:47.370 --> 21:48.570
he swung a blade at me.

21:49.110 --> 21:50.830
Had my mother not discovered us

21:50.830 --> 21:52.230
and fought to restrain him,

21:52.230 --> 21:53.630
I would have been killed.

21:54.590 --> 21:56.660
Then, fearing the truth would come out,

21:56.660 --> 21:57.920
he deceived my mother,

21:58.200 --> 21:59.030
claming he was sending me

21:59.030 --> 22:00.630
to a clan uncle's for safety,

22:00.960 --> 22:03.070
but in fact, he sold me far away,

22:03.920 --> 22:06.200
to a place I could never return to--Linji.

22:06.200 --> 22:07.640
I took advantage when the guards
on the ship weren't watching,

22:07.640 --> 22:08.680
jumped into the water,

22:08.680 --> 22:10.960
and survived by the skin of my teeth.

22:11.520 --> 22:13.850
Now you tell me,
why I dare not show my face?

22:15.410 --> 22:16.450
Tell me!

22:20.150 --> 22:20.930
Listen to this!

22:20.930 --> 22:23.260
What kind of brother would do such things!

22:25.550 --> 22:26.240
How can there exist

22:26.240 --> 22:28.700
such a
savage and vile creature in the world?

22:29.350 --> 22:30.150
Yang Jisheng,

22:31.270 --> 22:32.400
do you plead guilty?

22:33.200 --> 22:33.880
My Lord.

22:35.470 --> 22:37.470
Since my sister Yun's tragic death,

22:37.570 --> 22:39.650
and with the true killer still at large,

22:39.650 --> 22:41.110
my mother wept day after day.

22:41.110 --> 22:43.160
Her profound grief turned to illness,

22:43.160 --> 22:45.400
and she passed away five years ago.

22:46.110 --> 22:49.000
This woman implicates innocent people,

22:49.020 --> 22:50.420
speaks nothing but lies,

22:50.590 --> 22:52.900
even fabricates stories
about my deceased mother.

22:52.900 --> 22:54.820
How shameless she is!

22:56.110 --> 22:56.720
Fine.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.830
You keep claiming

22:58.830 --> 23:00.160
that you are Madam Yang.

23:00.880 --> 23:02.340
Where are your witnesses?

23:02.350 --> 23:04.810
The entire Wei family is implicated
and can't testify.

23:04.810 --> 23:05.870
What about others?

23:06.120 --> 23:07.720
Among Linji's million residents,

23:07.720 --> 23:09.550
can you find even one witness?

23:10.150 --> 23:11.900
No matter how eloquent you're,

23:12.220 --> 23:13.960
a lie can never become the truth.

23:13.960 --> 23:14.520
You...

23:16.030 --> 23:18.830
What you said sounds reasonable.

23:19.720 --> 23:21.270
You claim to be Madam Yang,

23:22.550 --> 23:24.310
but who can vouch for you?

23:24.960 --> 23:26.160
Without witnesses,

23:27.110 --> 23:29.040
you're making false accusations.

23:29.550 --> 23:30.960
Lord Xu wants witness?

23:30.960 --> 23:32.270
Why'd there be any cause for concern?

23:32.270 --> 23:34.130
The doctor who treated Madam Yang

23:34.440 --> 23:35.750
and the Rong family that took her in

23:35.750 --> 23:37.500
are both still waiting their turn
before the court.

23:37.500 --> 23:37.960
Guards!

23:38.830 --> 23:40.560
Take Yang Jisheng into custody

23:40.790 --> 23:42.070
for further questioning tomorrow.

23:42.070 --> 23:43.110
Yes! Take him away.

23:43.110 --> 23:44.370
I'm innocent, My Lord!

23:44.750 --> 23:45.210
My Lord!

23:45.310 --> 23:47.200
I'm innocent, My Lord!

23:47.510 --> 23:48.070
I'm innocent!

23:48.070 --> 23:48.880
So that's really happened?

23:48.880 --> 23:49.310
Isn't it?

23:49.310 --> 23:50.200
Let's come back tomorrow
and see how it ends.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.530
-My Lord!
-Lord Lu's handling of this matter

23:51.530 --> 23:53.060
has been indeed exemplary.

23:53.380 --> 23:54.380
Court adjourned.

23:58.400 --> 23:59.130
Impressive!

23:59.240 --> 24:00.240
It has to be Lord Lu

24:00.240 --> 24:02.040
to bring justice for Madam Yang.

24:12.680 --> 24:13.410
Well judged!

24:14.000 --> 24:15.200
Well judged, Lord Lu!

24:26.070 --> 24:26.870
I can hear you.

24:29.510 --> 24:30.790
I'm impressed
you dared to call the siblings

24:30.790 --> 24:31.750
to testify against each other in court.

24:31.750 --> 24:32.350
You provoked Madam Yang

24:32.350 --> 24:33.880
into revealing the truth about that year.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.720
Had it been me,

24:35.070 --> 24:35.920
uncertain whether the siblings

24:35.920 --> 24:37.550
had conspired from the start,

24:37.550 --> 24:40.480
I'd have been far too cautious
to take on such a great risk.

24:40.480 --> 24:40.880
Guard!

24:42.830 --> 24:43.680
Yes? My Lord?

24:44.240 --> 24:45.700
Post a notice immediately

24:45.750 --> 24:47.590
to search for witnesses
throughout the city.

24:47.590 --> 24:48.590
I think the Yang family in Linji

24:48.590 --> 24:50.310
can't completely control everything.

24:50.310 --> 24:51.620
With a generous reward,

24:51.620 --> 24:53.400
brave people will surely
come forward as witnesses.

24:53.400 --> 24:53.750
Yes!

24:57.160 --> 24:58.310
Why are you worried?

24:58.920 --> 25:00.540
Didn't Madam Yang already say?

25:00.540 --> 25:02.640
She miscarried
and escaped from the Wei family,

25:02.640 --> 25:04.440
and was saved by Doctor Luo Ping,

25:04.720 --> 25:06.270
who specializes in gynecology

25:06.270 --> 25:08.110
and practices regularly in the area
around Chunning and Yangzhong.

25:08.110 --> 25:10.210
As long as
you send someone to find him tonight,

25:10.210 --> 25:12.070
he will show up in court tomorrow.

25:13.440 --> 25:14.170
Just in case.

25:19.920 --> 25:21.350
What you concern makes sense.

25:21.350 --> 25:23.510
We must consider
the possibility of sabotage.

25:23.510 --> 25:24.120
However,

25:25.900 --> 25:26.790
tomorrow Miss Rong

25:26.790 --> 25:28.450
will appear in court herself.

25:28.920 --> 25:30.520
Have you thought it through?

25:33.670 --> 25:35.070
I dare not think about it.

25:37.440 --> 25:39.200
Madam Yang escaped from
a desperate situation,

25:39.200 --> 25:40.930
and the Rong family took her in.

25:41.120 --> 25:43.590
This is understandable,
both emotionally and morally.

25:43.590 --> 25:44.850
But in terms of the law,

25:44.960 --> 25:47.110
Wei Kejian is in prison
awaiting execution,

25:47.110 --> 25:49.590
and many Wei clan members
have been exiled due to lawsuits,

25:49.590 --> 25:51.050
suffering for many years.

25:52.070 --> 25:53.730
Now that I've taken this case,

25:54.120 --> 25:55.890
we must handle this impartially

25:55.890 --> 25:58.150
without giving in to personal feelings.

25:59.880 --> 26:01.070
I wonder how she'll

26:02.710 --> 26:04.110
face the court tomorrow.

26:26.030 --> 26:26.830
Mother.

26:38.900 --> 26:39.830
I'm not crying.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.020
Don't tell anyone.

26:45.160 --> 26:46.160
Grandmother said

26:46.750 --> 26:49.480
Miss Rong of the Rong family
is not allowed to cry.

26:53.290 --> 26:56.170
It's all right. You can cry in private.

26:57.000 --> 26:58.240
No one will see you.

27:20.760 --> 27:21.370
Miss Rong.

27:25.600 --> 27:28.260
Are you really
not going to see him one more time?

27:30.830 --> 27:32.490
He is the Imperial Inspector,

27:32.830 --> 27:34.890
and it's his duty to review old cases.

27:35.550 --> 27:37.400
I'm a daughter of the Rong family,

27:37.400 --> 27:40.440
naturally being obligated
to defend my family's honor.

27:40.440 --> 27:41.840
He talks to me about laws,

27:42.130 --> 27:43.590
but I don't want to listen.

27:43.830 --> 27:46.070
I appealed to
his sense of personal obligation,

27:46.070 --> 27:47.730
he'd not yield an inch either.

27:48.450 --> 27:50.110
We'd better not to meet at all.

27:51.860 --> 27:52.490
Miss Rong.

27:54.310 --> 27:55.970
You've cut off all the leaves.

28:02.200 --> 28:03.550
It is indeed difficult

28:04.440 --> 28:06.430
to confront one's beloved in open court.

28:06.430 --> 28:07.110
Miss Rong, you don't have to

28:07.110 --> 28:08.910
put on a brave face in front of me.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.570
I won't laugh at you.

28:11.240 --> 28:12.440
But I am Rong Shanbao.

28:18.960 --> 28:20.420
Rong Shanbao doesn't lose

28:21.880 --> 28:22.740
and can't lose.

28:39.600 --> 28:40.060
My Lord.

28:44.590 --> 28:46.190
There's not a single person.

28:46.590 --> 28:47.720
It's quite strange.

28:47.820 --> 28:49.110
Local customs are quite open.

28:49.110 --> 28:50.590
Even ladies from
the most secluded households

28:50.590 --> 28:53.200
venture out during the Lantern Festival
and the New Year.

28:53.200 --> 28:55.000
This is especially true for Madam Yang,

28:55.000 --> 28:56.110
who grew up
and was married right in Linji.

28:56.110 --> 28:57.880
We've asked at shops
selling rouge and bracelets,

28:57.880 --> 28:59.170
and the old clothing stores,

28:59.170 --> 29:00.210
all households,

29:01.000 --> 29:02.860
yet not a single person knows her.

29:03.200 --> 29:04.400
Unless she never left her home

29:04.400 --> 29:06.160
and never socialized with others,

29:06.160 --> 29:06.790
but this Wei family

29:06.790 --> 29:08.050
is in the tea business.

29:08.350 --> 29:09.070
How could the hostess

29:09.070 --> 29:10.400
live in such isolation?

29:10.650 --> 29:11.980
Something's not right.

29:13.030 --> 29:14.920
There's always someone more powerful.

29:14.920 --> 29:17.920
Keep your voice down.
Don't draw trouble to yourself.

29:22.520 --> 29:23.550
What mighty stature
for a mere Linji Prefect,

29:23.550 --> 29:25.610
to hold the entire city in such thrall

29:25.720 --> 29:27.850
that not a whisper of testimony

29:28.890 --> 29:30.030
can be heard.

29:31.240 --> 29:33.240
A single hand blots out the heavens!

29:33.790 --> 29:35.790
Do they have any respect for the law?

29:37.380 --> 29:38.910
My Lord, that Doctor Luo...

29:39.160 --> 29:39.720
Doctor Luo, he...

29:39.720 --> 29:40.920
What happened to him?

29:40.990 --> 29:42.590
Constables went to his home
to take him in,

29:42.590 --> 29:44.160
but it turned out
he went up the mountain yesterday

29:44.160 --> 29:45.790
to pick herbs, fell into a ravine,

29:45.790 --> 29:46.450
and died...

29:47.110 --> 29:47.590
He died.

29:51.300 --> 29:53.830
Let's return
to the Government Office first.

30:32.720 --> 30:34.590
I killed her. I killed her.

30:35.010 --> 30:35.920
I killed her.

30:36.400 --> 30:37.130
Look at this.

30:37.480 --> 30:38.440
I killed her.

30:39.870 --> 30:40.630
Well done.

30:47.160 --> 30:47.960
I killed her.

30:50.890 --> 30:51.680
I killed her.

30:51.710 --> 30:53.230
[Linji Prefectural Office]

30:52.590 --> 30:55.070
Mighty.

30:55.070 --> 30:57.680
Powerful.

31:00.720 --> 31:03.130
Bring Rong Shanbao for questioning.

31:06.040 --> 31:08.440
So it really is
Miss Rong of the Rong family?

31:10.030 --> 31:10.760
Impressive.

31:10.950 --> 31:12.350
Even the Rong family was summoned.

31:12.350 --> 31:13.590
What a rare occasion.

31:15.480 --> 31:17.200
What connection does
this case have with the Rong family

31:17.200 --> 31:18.850
that even Miss Rong has been called in?

31:18.850 --> 31:20.510
Indeed. Why is Miss Rong here?

31:21.160 --> 31:22.070
Make way.

31:22.070 --> 31:22.730
Step aside.

31:23.440 --> 31:24.370
Let her through.

31:39.920 --> 31:41.320
Greetings to both lords.

31:45.190 --> 31:45.720
Silence!

31:45.750 --> 31:48.030
Mighty.

31:48.030 --> 31:50.440
Powerful.

31:53.030 --> 31:53.680
Miss Rong,

31:55.240 --> 31:56.300
take a closer look.

31:57.160 --> 31:58.620
Do you recognize this lady

31:58.690 --> 31:59.450
in the court?

32:05.960 --> 32:07.620
I haven't noticed her before.

32:08.590 --> 32:09.640
I personally led people

32:09.640 --> 32:11.440
to arrest her from Rong Mansion.

32:11.650 --> 32:13.450
You claim you've never seen her?

32:14.160 --> 32:14.710
Lord Lu.

32:16.020 --> 32:17.820
The Rong family has 300 servants

32:17.830 --> 32:19.160
and 30,000 tea workers.

32:19.480 --> 32:20.940
If I need to know everyone,

32:21.340 --> 32:22.350
even if I have ten heads,

32:22.350 --> 32:23.550
that won't be enough.

32:26.940 --> 32:28.740
She's just an ordinary servant,

32:29.310 --> 32:30.640
yet why did Lady Yunwan
of the Rong family

32:30.640 --> 32:31.770
refuse to let her go?

32:32.440 --> 32:33.830
Miss Rong, you carefully attend to

32:33.830 --> 32:35.360
Lady Yunwan's daily needs.

32:36.270 --> 32:37.550
How could you not recognize

32:37.550 --> 32:38.750
someone close to her?

32:46.270 --> 32:47.130
I remember now.

32:47.960 --> 32:48.790
Since childhood, Yunwan

32:48.790 --> 32:50.550
was served by the maid Madam Liang,

32:50.550 --> 32:52.210
to whom she was very attached.

32:52.790 --> 32:53.790
Three months ago,

32:54.110 --> 32:56.480
Madam Liang
returned to Qiongzhou to retire.

32:56.480 --> 32:58.210
Yunwan became ill with longing

32:58.350 --> 32:59.950
and moved out to recuperate.

33:00.510 --> 33:01.910
Later when I visited her,

33:02.160 --> 33:03.070
I discovered that Yunwan

33:03.070 --> 33:04.600
had taken in a female beggar

33:05.310 --> 33:07.920
because she resembled Madam Liang.

33:08.440 --> 33:10.440
It was just transference of affection.

33:10.440 --> 33:12.160
My sister had a childish nature

33:12.160 --> 33:13.760
that changed from day to day.

33:14.070 --> 33:15.880
Since she wanted to keep a servant,

33:15.880 --> 33:17.340
I didn't inquire further.

33:17.640 --> 33:19.500
Today when My Lord asked about it,

33:19.880 --> 33:21.210
I suddenly remembered.

33:22.390 --> 33:23.990
But My Lord seems so certain.

33:24.480 --> 33:25.400
Could it be

33:26.000 --> 33:26.920
that you've met

33:26.920 --> 33:28.520
the real Madam Liang before?

33:33.670 --> 33:35.600
Not a word of truth. Complete lies!

33:39.210 --> 33:41.200
How would he dare admit
in front of everyone

33:41.200 --> 33:43.310
that he infiltrated
the Rong family with ill intent?

33:43.310 --> 33:45.200
Or should I say he's shameless enough

33:45.200 --> 33:47.170
to sacrifice himself
for a fraudulent marriage?

33:47.170 --> 33:47.610
You!

33:52.410 --> 33:54.270
How could she be easily cornered?

33:55.270 --> 33:57.330
Miss Rong is indeed calm and composed

33:58.640 --> 34:00.240
and doesn't back down at all.

34:01.030 --> 34:01.690
Madam Yang.

34:02.160 --> 34:04.200
I know
you don't want to betray your benefactor

34:04.200 --> 34:06.070
by testifying against them in court.

34:06.070 --> 34:07.920
But since
you've already appeared as a witness,

34:07.920 --> 34:08.960
if you back out now,

34:08.960 --> 34:10.750
it will be a serious crime
of false accusation.

34:10.750 --> 34:12.840
Making false accusations
will result in punishment.

34:12.840 --> 34:14.630
The Rong family claims you were a beggar

34:14.630 --> 34:15.960
taken in by Lady Yunwan.

34:16.139 --> 34:17.960
A servant
who has only been there for three months

34:17.960 --> 34:20.230
would hardly know
the details of the Rong Mansion.

34:20.230 --> 34:21.960
If you truly are Madam Yang's daughter,

34:21.960 --> 34:24.030
who is literate and skilled in painting,

34:24.030 --> 34:25.570
and have lived with
the Rong family for ten years,

34:25.570 --> 34:27.030
then rendering the plants and gardens

34:27.030 --> 34:28.550
of Rong Mansion should be easy for you.

34:28.550 --> 34:30.400
I order you to draw here in court,

34:30.880 --> 34:32.630
so we can verify the details to check

34:32.630 --> 34:34.230
whether your account is true

34:34.230 --> 34:35.760
or Miss Rong's is correct.

34:37.670 --> 34:39.730
The truth will become self-evident.

34:45.360 --> 34:47.960
Madam Yang, do you dare or not?

34:54.070 --> 34:56.230
I'll do as you command, My Lord.

34:57.230 --> 34:58.000
Wait.

34:58.880 --> 34:59.510
Lord Lu,

35:00.400 --> 35:01.070
there remains the single

35:01.070 --> 35:02.630
most crucial witness

35:03.000 --> 35:04.400
you have yet to question.

35:05.680 --> 35:08.900
Guards, bring in the prisoner Wei Kejian.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.000
Look!

35:22.360 --> 35:23.590
What have they done to him?

35:23.590 --> 35:24.190
This is...

35:24.960 --> 35:25.320
Just look.

35:25.320 --> 35:26.190
He's unrecognizable now.

35:26.190 --> 35:27.650
Totally unrecognizable.

35:28.280 --> 35:29.680
Didn't Wei Kejian go mad?

35:30.110 --> 35:31.570
How can he appear in court?

35:33.840 --> 35:35.710
Young Master? Young Master?

35:37.190 --> 35:39.190
Though that man is still breathing,

35:39.840 --> 35:42.630
he's been tortured
until there's barely any life left in him,

35:42.630 --> 35:44.630
hardly looking like a living person.

35:44.630 --> 35:46.090
What happened to this man?

35:48.840 --> 35:49.400
Lord Xu.

35:50.150 --> 35:52.210
This prisoner is already delirious.

35:52.320 --> 35:54.180
You summoned Wei Kejian to court.

35:54.190 --> 35:55.000
Could it be that you want him

35:55.000 --> 35:56.330
to identify Madam Yang?

35:56.480 --> 35:57.740
Look at his condition.

35:58.090 --> 36:00.490
Can he even recognize
who's in front of him?

36:00.960 --> 36:01.670
Wei Kejian!

36:03.760 --> 36:05.400
Did you kill Madam Yang?

36:08.760 --> 36:09.490
I killed her.

36:10.550 --> 36:11.280
I killed her.

36:11.340 --> 36:11.870
It was me.

36:12.070 --> 36:14.110
I used a wooden pick

36:14.760 --> 36:15.840
to strike her dead.

36:17.330 --> 36:20.440
I wanted her dead!
I wanted her dead! I wanted her dead!

36:21.310 --> 36:24.350
Kill! Kill! Kill!

36:24.440 --> 36:25.480
The prisoner has confessed.

36:25.480 --> 36:26.440
He killed Madam Yang.

36:26.440 --> 36:27.760
That woman is an impostor!

36:27.760 --> 36:28.880
He spoke so clearly.

36:28.880 --> 36:30.800
He must be the killer without doubt.

36:30.800 --> 36:32.170
He was just pretending to be mad.

36:32.170 --> 36:34.500
Yes, he's pretending to be mad and stupid.

36:38.480 --> 36:40.630
Wei Kejian committed this heinous murder.

36:40.630 --> 36:42.560
Remorse and fear drove him insane.

36:42.840 --> 36:44.510
Now he reveals the truth in court.

36:44.510 --> 36:45.710
This is heaven's justice.

36:45.710 --> 36:47.000
Good and evil
will always be rewarded accordingly.

36:47.000 --> 36:48.870
We can't let Madam Yang die in vain,

36:48.870 --> 36:50.870
nor allow others to impersonate her

36:50.920 --> 36:52.250
with malicious intent.

36:52.630 --> 36:54.840
Who helped you carry and bury the body?

36:55.510 --> 36:55.970
Tell us!

36:58.110 --> 36:58.760
Wei Laowu.

37:00.400 --> 37:00.930
Wei Ming.

37:01.630 --> 37:02.160
Wei Ming.

37:02.990 --> 37:03.590
Wei Laowu.

37:04.430 --> 37:04.960
Wei Ming.

37:07.000 --> 37:08.190
Whether he is truly insane

37:08.190 --> 37:09.320
or just pretending,

37:09.560 --> 37:11.360
I will have someone examine him.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.510
Guards! Take Wei Kejian away.

37:16.710 --> 37:17.070
Move.

37:21.840 --> 37:24.040
My Lord, this woman took down the notice

37:24.710 --> 37:26.510
and came to identify Madam Yang.

37:27.040 --> 37:30.040
I, Zhang, pay my respects to both lords.

37:31.890 --> 37:34.600
My Lord, I know this woman.

37:35.510 --> 37:38.480
Her surname is Wang,
given name is Dongling.

37:38.760 --> 37:40.820
She was from the Jia family in Luzhou,

37:40.840 --> 37:42.500
a concubine of Old Master Jia.

37:42.700 --> 37:44.550
Because the legal wife
couldn't tolerate her,

37:44.550 --> 37:46.360
she was sold several times

37:46.360 --> 37:47.480
until she came to me.

37:47.480 --> 37:48.480
Over these years,

37:48.920 --> 37:51.400
she grew old
and was not as pretty as she used to be,

37:51.400 --> 37:52.710
so she couldn't treat clients anymore.

37:52.710 --> 37:54.110
So I was planning

37:54.110 --> 37:54.710
to send her to

37:54.710 --> 37:56.110
a nunnery to settle down.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.790
But who would have thought

37:57.790 --> 37:59.390
she would escape on the way

37:59.760 --> 38:01.490
and disappear without a trace?

38:02.190 --> 38:03.720
If you don't believe me, My Lords,

38:03.720 --> 38:05.250
you can remove her clothes.

38:05.630 --> 38:06.590
On her left arm

38:06.760 --> 38:08.550
is a scar from a candleholder

38:08.760 --> 38:10.490
that I myself branded onto her.

38:12.320 --> 38:14.320
My Lord, here is the witness.

38:17.710 --> 38:19.760
You despicable beast!

38:20.360 --> 38:21.510
That's a scar from some mischief

38:21.510 --> 38:23.070
-when I was a kid.
-You crazy woman!

38:23.070 --> 38:25.000
How dare you cause a scene in court!

38:25.000 --> 38:25.600
Seize her!

38:25.630 --> 38:26.890
She's hitting people!

38:27.760 --> 38:28.440
Pull them apart!

38:28.440 --> 38:29.480
-Stop her.
-No one is more shameless

38:29.480 --> 38:31.360
than you!

38:32.070 --> 38:33.550
Tell me who I am.

38:33.880 --> 38:36.590
Tell me! Who am I?

38:37.450 --> 38:39.180
Tell me!

38:40.490 --> 38:41.860
Speak up.

38:42.800 --> 38:43.920
I am Yang Yun

38:43.920 --> 38:46.360
who was ruined by you.

38:46.360 --> 38:50.590
You all made my life worse than death.

38:53.480 --> 38:56.280
Tell me who I am.

39:04.280 --> 39:05.280
Court adjourned.

39:05.550 --> 39:06.550
Court adjourned.

39:21.510 --> 39:22.110
Miss Rong.

39:22.630 --> 39:23.800
Lady Yunyin refuses to eat or drink

39:23.800 --> 39:24.960
in the tea plantation.

39:24.960 --> 39:26.880
She says if you don't take her back,

39:26.880 --> 39:29.110
she would rather starve herself to death.

39:29.110 --> 39:29.920
Let her be.

39:31.510 --> 39:32.000
Wait.

39:33.450 --> 39:34.760
Bring her to me at 4 p.m.

39:36.550 --> 39:37.350
You may go now.

39:47.070 --> 39:48.600
So she knows to take me back?

39:48.670 --> 39:50.290
Why not just
let me die in the tea plantation?

39:50.290 --> 39:50.870
It would have been perfect for her

39:50.870 --> 39:53.550
to use my corpse
as fertilizer for her beloved tea trees.

39:53.550 --> 39:55.110
No matter how many mistakes I've made,

39:55.110 --> 39:56.310
I'm still her sister.

39:56.710 --> 39:58.230
If Mother knew how cruelly she treats me,

39:58.230 --> 40:00.760
Mother'd die
without closing her eyes in peace.

40:00.760 --> 40:02.220
Lady Yunyin must be tired.

40:02.230 --> 40:03.630
Please rest well for a day.

40:03.630 --> 40:05.230
Tomorrow,
after paying respects at Chongxi Hall,

40:05.230 --> 40:08.360
the carriage will be waiting outside
at 7 in the morning.

40:09.510 --> 40:10.280
The weather is getting cooler.

40:10.280 --> 40:11.640
Nights in the mountains are cold.

40:11.640 --> 40:12.510
Miss Rong has instructed

40:12.510 --> 40:13.800
to prepare more warm clothes for you.

40:13.800 --> 40:15.660
I'll send them all together then.

40:15.920 --> 40:16.710
What?

40:17.910 --> 40:19.640
She still wants to send me away?

40:22.550 --> 40:24.550
Where is she? I'll go see her myself.

40:24.840 --> 40:25.770
Tell me quickly!

40:27.590 --> 40:29.320
Miss Rong is in the Flower Hall.

40:29.440 --> 40:32.300
She has important matters
to discuss with Mr. Yang.

40:33.030 --> 40:33.760
Lady Yunyin!

40:35.070 --> 40:35.880
Lady Yunyin!

40:36.240 --> 40:37.910
Don't be rash, Lady Yunyin!

40:47.550 --> 40:50.230
Who gave your Yang family permission
to make decisions on your own?

40:50.230 --> 40:52.430
What's the story with that woman Zhang?

40:52.960 --> 40:53.760
Mr. Yang.

40:54.280 --> 40:55.960
Yang Yun is your own aunt.

40:56.360 --> 40:58.190
How can you resort to
such underhanded tricks?

40:58.190 --> 41:00.030
Don't you fear
it will curse you with misfortune?

41:00.030 --> 41:02.070
This is a life-or-death crisis
for the Yang family.

41:02.070 --> 41:03.320
If we can get through this,

41:03.320 --> 41:04.710
I will personally go to apologize,

41:04.710 --> 41:06.320
and accept whatever punishment
my aunt gives me.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.510
Even if my knees
are worn raw from kneeling,

41:07.510 --> 41:09.040
I won't even furrow my brow.

41:09.230 --> 41:10.190
For the rest of my life,

41:10.190 --> 41:12.070
I, Yang Yitang,
will serve my aunt until her final days,

41:12.070 --> 41:13.330
as if I were her own son.

41:14.150 --> 41:15.750
But if we don't survive this,

41:16.840 --> 41:19.400
and if the Yang family
is convicted of false accusations,

41:19.400 --> 41:20.960
we'll face execution,
exile, death, and ruin.

41:20.960 --> 41:22.820
How would we support my aunt then?

41:23.110 --> 41:24.030
These stakes and consequences

41:24.030 --> 41:25.320
aren't clear to outsiders.

41:25.320 --> 41:27.600
Miss Rong is a person
of great undertakings

41:27.600 --> 41:29.240
and should be magnanimous.

41:29.880 --> 41:31.280
What lofty rhetoric!

41:32.100 --> 41:34.230
Your cheek is thicker
than the city walls.

41:34.230 --> 41:35.150
Truly, you've even outshone

41:35.150 --> 41:36.810
your families in brazenness.

41:37.400 --> 41:38.600
Don't gloat too soon.

41:39.400 --> 41:40.200
Don't forget,

41:41.960 --> 41:43.360
my younger sister Yunwan

41:43.550 --> 41:45.810
has lived with Madam Yang for many years.

41:45.880 --> 41:47.510
They're as close as mother and daughter.

41:47.510 --> 41:49.240
If she were to testify in court,

41:49.800 --> 41:52.200
she could overturn everyone's testimony.

41:53.030 --> 41:55.590
That's exactly
what I'm asking for your help, Miss Rong.

41:55.590 --> 41:57.150
Before the lawsuit is settled,

41:57.150 --> 41:59.230
please properly arrange for Lady Yunwan,

41:59.230 --> 42:00.880
and don't let her rashly appear

42:00.880 --> 42:03.680
to ruin
the important matters of our two families.

42:25.280 --> 42:25.920
Miss Rong.

42:26.670 --> 42:28.330
Please forgive me, Miss Rong.

42:28.920 --> 42:30.780
I'm also forced into this corner.

42:31.360 --> 42:32.480
I implore you,

42:32.870 --> 42:35.530
please spare
the lives of my entire Yang family.

42:39.280 --> 42:40.000
Miss Rong.

42:41.230 --> 42:44.280
Fine. For the sake of
the Rong family's reputation,

42:45.320 --> 42:47.590
I'll have to go against
my conscience this once.

42:47.590 --> 42:48.800
Tonight I will send Yunwan

42:48.800 --> 42:50.920
to stay at the newly opened
tea plantation.

42:50.920 --> 42:52.590
Before the lawsuit is settled,

42:52.590 --> 42:54.390
I won't let her appear in public.

43:02.700 --> 43:04.500
Miss, it's Lady Yunyin!

43:05.230 --> 43:06.750
Fourth Sister, you've returned.

43:06.750 --> 43:08.400
Eldest Sister is discussing matters
in the Flower Hall.

43:08.400 --> 43:10.130
Did you see her, Fourth Sister?

43:15.710 --> 43:16.440
Lady Yunyin,

43:16.760 --> 43:17.960
why did you come here?

43:18.000 --> 43:20.260
You had me searching everywhere for you.

43:20.400 --> 43:22.630
All right, I'm leaving now.

43:23.150 --> 43:24.840
But you must let me go back
to pack my autumn clothes

43:24.840 --> 43:26.640
and say goodbye to grandmother.

43:27.910 --> 43:29.240
See you, Fourth Sister.

43:34.800 --> 43:35.530
Lady Yunshu.

46:10.920 --> 46:13.220
[Landscape and Tea in Zhejiang]

46:19.710 --> 46:20.970
Who would have thought

46:21.800 --> 46:22.510
that tea trees could thrive alongside

46:22.510 --> 46:24.870
wild chrysanthemums
and grow so vigorously?

46:24.870 --> 46:26.660
I recall
Miss Rong mentioned that next year,

46:26.660 --> 46:29.000
varieties of chrysanthemum
are to be carefully chosen

46:29.000 --> 46:30.310
for both petals and roots

46:30.310 --> 46:31.840
that can be used in medicine.

46:31.840 --> 46:33.700
The Rong Family ancestors
moved to Jiangnan

46:33.700 --> 46:35.230
and has run the tea business

46:35.250 --> 46:36.480
for over 100 years.

46:37.030 --> 46:37.920
The Tea King Rong Family

46:37.920 --> 46:39.400
became renowned throughout the land

46:39.400 --> 46:40.180
mainly because of

46:40.180 --> 46:41.720
favorable timing,
geography, and human factors.

46:41.720 --> 46:43.360
Tea trees prefer moisture,

46:43.380 --> 46:44.290
and their growing environment

46:44.290 --> 46:45.620
requires sufficient water

46:45.620 --> 46:48.090
with ideal temperatures
between 10 and 30 degrees Celsius.

46:48.090 --> 46:49.380
Tea trees thrive in

46:49.410 --> 46:50.290
deep,

46:50.310 --> 46:50.980
fertile,

46:51.080 --> 46:51.770
loose,

46:51.920 --> 46:53.400
and well-draining soil.

46:54.090 --> 46:55.220
Loamy soil

46:55.250 --> 46:56.480
or sandy loam is preferred.

46:56.480 --> 46:58.250
These soil types benefit

46:58.270 --> 47:00.800
the growth and development
of tea tree root systems.

47:00.800 --> 47:02.460
Additionally, our Rong Family members,

47:02.460 --> 47:04.000
through a century of dedication,

47:04.000 --> 47:06.180
continuously improved
tea processing techniques,

47:06.180 --> 47:07.430
optimized soil conditions,

47:07.430 --> 47:08.850
sought superior tea varieties,

47:08.850 --> 47:10.110
and expanded markets,

47:10.140 --> 47:11.090
which made the Tea King Rong Family

47:11.090 --> 47:12.290
a prestigious brand

47:12.330 --> 47:13.790
famous throughout China.

47:14.000 --> 47:15.390
Today's Zhejiang Province

47:15.390 --> 47:16.380
is one of China's largest

47:16.380 --> 47:17.840
tea-producing provinces.

47:17.840 --> 47:19.900
It's known as the land of silk and tea.

47:19.990 --> 47:21.400
Tea is Zhejiang's

47:21.420 --> 47:22.630
most prominent

47:22.660 --> 47:23.760
agricultural industry.

47:23.760 --> 47:25.750
[Ten Famous Tea]

47:24.080 --> 47:25.670
Famous teas it produces include:

47:25.670 --> 47:27.070
West Lake's Longjing tea,

47:27.070 --> 47:28.130
Dafo Longjing Tea,

47:28.450 --> 47:29.650
Kaihua Longjing Tea,

47:29.780 --> 47:30.940
Anji White Tea,

47:31.050 --> 47:32.380
Wuyang Spring Rain Tea,

47:32.500 --> 47:33.930
Songyang Silver Monkey Tea,

47:33.930 --> 47:34.940
Jingshan Tea,

47:35.080 --> 47:36.450
Gold Medal Huiming Tea,

47:36.660 --> 47:37.560
Wanghai Tea,

47:37.580 --> 47:38.660
Green Sword Tea.

47:39.030 --> 47:40.570
These premium teas have now become

47:40.570 --> 47:41.520
the economic backbone of

47:41.520 --> 47:42.590
Zhejiang's tea industry,

47:42.590 --> 47:44.060
playing a positive role in driving

47:44.060 --> 47:46.250
the sustained growth
of agricultural economy

47:46.250 --> 47:48.160
in the province's mountainous regions,

47:48.160 --> 47:49.990
while also contributing

47:50.160 --> 47:51.340
to the development of China's tea industry

47:51.340 --> 47:52.370
and the global trade in green tea.
